% Uppercase is lower octave B, = B3, A = A4, b = B5, c` = C6
% One line per system of sheets/Leonardi_Tarantella.pdf (10 rows, 65 bars). L:1/8, so a bare
% letter is an eighth, 2 is a quarter. A sharp holds for the rest of its bar, as in the score.
%%syncpage page=1 rows=10
