%%sync page=1 row=3
ded cAB | cBA Bcd | e^f^g a2 z | EEE ^GGG | BBB AAA | ccc BBB | ddd cBA |
%%sync page=1 row=4
eee ^ggg | bbb aaa | fgf efe | dcB A2 z | EEE ^GGG | BBB AAA |
%%sync page=1 row=5
ccc BBB | ddd cBA | eee ^ggg | bbb aaa | fgf efe | dcB A2 z | (ee)e (de)e |
%%sync page=1 row=6
(Be)e (ce)e | (Ae)e (Be)e | (de)e (ce)e | (ee)e (de)e | (Be)e (ce)e | (Ae)e Bcd | e^f^g a2 z |
